{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0275-when-should-one-stop-the-most.md", "equation": "Aldous:** σ_A(x) = sin(πx)/π; **Bass:** σ_B(x) = φ(Φ⁻¹(x)); **binary inference:** σ_I(x) = x(1−x), all with ρ(s) = 1/√(S−s), A(s) = −log((S−s)/S), Γ(t) = S(1−e^{−t}) (so T = ∞).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9123}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0275-when-should-one-stop-the-most.md", "equation": "Generator:** ℒ = ½σ²(x)∂_xx; **value:** V_T(t,x) = inf_{τ≤T−t} E[∫₀^τ c(t+u)du + g(X^x_τ)].", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9123}
