{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0275-when-should-one-stop-the-most.md", "equation": "Derivative representations:** ∂_x V_T(t,x) = E[g′(X^x_{τ*})∂_x X^x_{τ*}] (6.6); time-derivative bounds E[c(t+τ*)] − c(t) ≤ ∂_t V_T ≤ … + K′′P(τ* = T−t) (6.13); infinite horizon exact: ∂_t V_∞ = E[c(t+τ*_∞)] − c(t) (6.14); PDE (∂_t + ℒ)V_T = −c(t) in 𝒞_T (6.28).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9123}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0276-kellybench-a-benchmark-for-longhorizon-sequential.md", "equation": "Kelly reward (§3.4):** dense per-matchday reward r_t = log W_{t+1} − log W_t (eq. 1); cumulative R = Σ r_t = log(W_{T+1}/W_1) (eq. 2) — the Kelly-optimal strategy maximizes expected log-wealth, i.e., long-run geometric growth.", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9123}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0276-kellybench-a-benchmark-for-longhorizon-sequential.md", "equation": "(1) Per-matchday reward:** r_t = log W_{t+1} − log W_t = log(W_{t+1}/W_t).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9123}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0276-kellybench-a-benchmark-for-longhorizon-sequential.md", "equation": "(2) Cumulative:** R = Σ_{t=1..T} r_t = log(W_{T+1}/W_1).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9123}
{"file": "C:/Users/Garrett/Sports/docs/arxiv-program/research/2026-09-21/arxiv-deep/0276-kellybench-a-benchmark-for-longhorizon-sequential.md", "equation": "Kelly growth:** W(b) = Σ_{x,y} p(x,y) log(b(x | y) = p(x | y); W* = I(X;Y).", "page_or_eqnum": null, "wave": 9123}
